{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae210c1833c9bf86b8408d3c40254a0da4e4023e93e17b4db8e8945ce95c5d5b", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。せっかく\nチャイナ服なので、中華街で撮ることになった）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。难得穿了旗袍，所以决定去唐人街拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "9148bcefaa9b5f879ae19440e28e131664bb802d33acf9df0a595a7b94005e9a", "ja": "ニーハオ、{$P$}！\n着替え終わったよ～！", "zh": "你好，{$P$}！\n我换好衣服啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ca15cf727995d370f15f3b29dae75b8ed4facd8b0d55e861038244f1f9f86898", "ja": "ニーハオ、恵美。\nいい感じにテンションが上がってるみたいだな。", "zh": "你好，惠美。看来你的情绪正好高涨起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "d0acbd6c544ed74241f094cfc5e2a08e5c400d02730e63694d18dce24d932e55", "ja": "えへへ～、わかる？　{$P$}が\n選んでくれた、この衣装のおかげだよ。", "zh": "嘿嘿～看得出来吗？多亏了{$P$}挑选的这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "c61694ca228775559b0bdf2757ab77d253978e9de28d08211a212586e7c62e0d", "ja": "もう、着てるだけで楽しくなってくるし、\n歩いてるだけで気持ちいいんだもん♪", "zh": "光是穿在身上就让人开心起来，\n而且只是走起路来都觉得好舒服呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1005_p", "source_sha256": "db6ca5c050b7d4bb9926d9be69718cfc6a6e8bcd8f5bb49fcb4d5c341caf15b7", "ja": "喜んでもらえて何よりだよ。それで、\n念の為なんだけど、どこか気になるところとかないか？", "zh": "你能喜欢就再好不过了。另外，\n以防万一还是问一下，有没有哪里觉得不太对劲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "d95ded293690a5840a05913b65cc3d1d90231f5c76efcf1669d7f8e105ab050a", "ja": "ないない。ほら、見て。アタシにぴったり♪\nボディラインもしっかり出てるし、色もバッチリ！", "zh": "没有没有。你看，很适合我♪  \n身材曲线也展现得很漂亮，颜色也恰到好处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "26d5dac87fdc5a7c45f2e9085441baf635aa5a762cc48257fc74a205e5ee34e2", "ja": "スリットもちょうどいい深さで入ってて、\n肌みせのバランスもちょうどいい感じ♪", "zh": "开衩的深度也刚刚好，\n露肤的程度也恰到好处♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8ef2de4c813eb3e99b185cf25191615ff8e177594fd77e10b52cb483c26ece96", "ja": "そうか、それならよかった。\n衣装の雰囲気、確かに恵美にピッタリだな。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。\n这套服装的感觉，确实和惠很相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "c0dcb426449d5818eff4250f985cb315a8fa466f067d38943df758a640061385", "ja": "あっ……そうだ、{$P$}！\nひとつだけ、ピッタリじゃないところがあるんだよね。", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}！\n有一个地方不太合适呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8aa390f7aaaafbd75f03cea2495f66e5bb102a42e2812a480f659297b5d39f86", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか。どこだ？", "zh": "诶，是吗？哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "7dd29ee9973f02ddb4b49a0b642f338979aaaeb3e8537736e41738753ece471d", "ja": "それは～……ここ！　胸元のライン！", "zh": "那就是～……这里！胸口的线条！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "2c5b71d2cbe047199458363928ea84917dca50b264124dab06638e02cc77549d", "ja": "サイズはぴったりなんだけど、\n胸の辺りだけ、なんかちょっときつく見えない？", "zh": "尺寸正合适，不过只有胸口这边，总觉得看起来有点紧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c6d762c5a2bd41ff0a03bf4aff5f992ab0d17c8be1cbf2632c544a53caf5580", "ja": "{$P$}から見て、きつそうじゃない？\nどう？　大丈夫そう？", "zh": "从{$P$}看来，不觉得有点紧吗？\n怎么样？看起来还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1014_p", "source_sha256": "29741e6dd5edf4548c24351d6652646295eebf73373a7a2912ced9b192aa2431", "ja": "え……いや、別に大丈夫だと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶……不，我觉得应该没什么问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "27f7c7ba6f556974083af47ec763aebac134de14be1275a440d194125c748669", "ja": "あれ、もしかしてなんか心配してる？\n仕事なんだから、気にしなくて大丈夫だって♪", "zh": "咦，难道你是在担心什么？\n这是工作嘛，不用在意啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f9fb0865f9a474a133ff2ca9175a3b9002306a91e8d9b3eba13ee838dd83f7af", "ja": "そう言われても、あまりジロジロ見るのもな……。\nそれに、何度見ても問題ないと思うけど。", "zh": "就算你这么说，也不太好一直盯着看吧……  \n而且，我觉得不管看多少次都没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "eb54c2c537ba3f6c7001adb9eb21c0b15be9d240a4280768bfd0c3d698333b89", "ja": "ま、でも{$P$}が\nそう言うなら、大丈夫かな！", "zh": "不过，既然{$P$}都这么说了，应该没问题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "4cf607c8053e6013b0fe5d85f17675742a47ff6f0115779eae6d06fa60ed3ddb", "ja": "んじゃ、そろそろ撮影いってくるね。カメラマンさんも\n通りがかりの人も、メロメロにしちゃおっかな～？", "zh": "那我差不多该去拍摄了。我要不要把摄影师和路人都迷得神魂颠倒呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "5f0f1f6750d768a75dd2dfcd81d4dc25e1c3baab6fdd0133927b254a469772be", "ja": "今の{$P$}みたいにね。にゃはは♪", "zh": "就像现在的{$P$}一样嘛。呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0203_1020_p", "source_sha256": "27e1282d14a0055c5ef47f85fdf46b0e5ce943717c94375fc15c9f0115965e96", "ja": "（恵美、撮影中もテンションが高めだったな……。\n恵美のチャイナ服で、みんなメロメロになるはずだ！）", "zh": "（惠美在拍摄时情绪也一直很高涨啊……\n穿上惠美的旗袍，大家肯定都会被迷得神魂颠倒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
